uwatta; East: Owner\n\n1A \u2013 G 044889 \u2013 14 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nunidentified Paragahahenawatta Pathinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta and Lot E in the same plan; South: Lots E and B; West: Lot B."
