    "chunk_text": "III \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.18\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 18.07.20253A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\n12. Lot \u2018N\u2019 \u2013 Paragahahenawatta Paththinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta, \u2013 Extent: 0.0276 Hectare North: Canal and Lot M in the same plan; East: Lots M, B and P; South: Lot P and the owner unidenti\ufb01 ed Paragahahenawatta Pathinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta; West: The owner unidentified Paragahahenawatta Pathinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta and Canal.\n\n13. Lot \u2018P\u2019 \u2013 Paragahahenawatta Paththinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta, \u2013 Extent: 0.0138 Hectare North: Lots N and B; East: Lot B and Lot No. 1 in the Preliminary Plan No. GA 3701; South: Lot Nos. 1 and 27 in the Preliminary Plan No. GA 3701 and the\n\nowner unidentified Paragahahenawatta Pathinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta; West: The owner unidentified Paragahahenawatta Pathinigewatta alias Miniranmaduwatta and Lot N.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No. : 4-3/15/2017/VE/341.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.09th April 2025\n\nEOG 07 - 0222"
