    "chunk_text": "Moreover, it is hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 25th September, the nature of their interest in the land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/ servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. Kasun Epa Senevirathne, Land Acquiring Officer and the Divisional Secretary, Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte. At the Divisional Secretariat of Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte, On 18th July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0257\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nMoreover, it is hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 25th September, 2025 the nature of their interest in the land/lands, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land/ servitude, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. Kasun Epa Senevirathne, Land Acquiring Officer and the Divisional Secretary, Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte. At the Divisional Secretariat of Sri Jayawardenepura Kotte, On 18th July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0258 S"
