    "chunk_text": "Dr. ANIL JAYANTHA FERNANDO, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,03rd July, 2025.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2022/167.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nand\n\nState Engineering Corporation of Sri Lanka, No. 130, W.A.D.Ramanayake Mawatha, Colombo 02.\n\nSTATEMENT OF MATTER IN DISPUTE\n\nThe matter in dispute between the aforesaid parties is \u2013\n\nWhether Mr.P.A.R. Jayasinghe Working in the post of Management Assistant (Audit Clerk ) of the State Engineering Corporation of Sri Lanka has been caused injustice by,\n\n- Being transferred to the Roads and Bridges Section for cover up duties as the Accounts Of\ufb01cer as an additional duty assignment through letter dated 11.05.2021\n\n- Not deing allowed to work in the Internal Audit Division inspite of being transferred to the Division from 02,06.2021\n\n- Being attached to the Human Resources and Administration Division from 07.06.2021\n\n- Being transferred to the Road Development Worksite - Kalutara on 21.06.2021\n\n- Being engaged in duties outside the duties of the post\n\nand if so, to what relief he is entitled.\n\nH. M. D. N. K. WATALIYADDA, Commissioner General of Labour.\n\nDated at the Of\ufb01ce of the Commissioner General of Labour,Colombo, on this 18th day of June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0241\n\n3AI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.21PART I: SEC. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 21.07.2025\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/03/2020/235.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nRevocation of Order under Section 4(1)"
