    "chunk_text": "North by : Lot No. 1006, 1033 and 421 of F.V.P. 542; East by : Lot No. 421 and part of Lot No. 420 of F.V.P. 542; South by : Part of Lot No. 420 of F.V.P. 542; West by : Part of Lot No. 420 and 1006 of F.V.P. 542.\n\nS. Puvanendran, Divisional Secretary, Lunugala. At Divisional Secretariat, Lunugala, 21st July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0294\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.07.24 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.07.2025\n\nRECTIFICATION SHEET\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nMy Ref. No. : DSM/WL/LND/4/3/8/8/27. Ref. No. of Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and\n\nIrrigation : 03J/91/IR/176. IT is hereby notifying that the date of land Title & Compensation inquiry was mentioned as 04.06.2025 that published in the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2436/13 and dated 17.05.2025 of Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, is revised since it could not be conducted in due date given in the said notification and I hereby amend the date of land Title & Compensation inquiry as at day of 08.10.2025.\n\nAll persons interested in the aforesaid land are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized\n\nin writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat Wilgamuwa in the 08th day of October, 2025 at 10.00 a.m.\n\nFurther, it is hereby notify me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 30th day of September 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.\n\nH. M. I. Siriwardhana, Divisional Secretary, Wilgamuwa. At Divisional Secretariat Wilgamuwa. EOG 07 - 0296\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
