    "chunk_text": "III fldgi \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'24PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 24.07.2025\n\n1A\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk1A \u2013 G 044944 \u2013 14 (07/2025)\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nOrder under Section 38 (b)\n\nOrder No. 52 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/10/2020/MV/288-G. Divisional SecretaryZs. Ref. No.: DSM/NU/LND/7/23-VIII. BY virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38 (b) of Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation, do hereby declare by this order that the lands referred to in Paragraph 1 of the Schedule are subjected to the servitude specfied in the correspinding entry in Paragraph 2 of that Schedule. K. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/06, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.6th June, 2025.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Description of the land.\u2013 Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Cadastral Map C. M. No. 310195, Block No.04, Sheet No.01 dated l6.02.2023 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the Village called Bibila and Penalaboda in No. E 413, Bibila Grama Nialadari Division in the Divisional Secretariat Division of Naula in Matale District of Central Province and bounded as follows:\n\n2. Description of servitude.\u2013 Acquisition of servitude of the land for the construction of the Bowathenna Tunnel and Constructions related to the North Western Province Canal Project:\n\n01. Lot No. 05 \u2013 Kadigalamukalana \u2013 Extent: 0.0411 HectareNorth: Lot No. 2; East: Bibila (a portion); South: Lot Nos. 8, 9 and 6; West: Lot No. 6 and Bibila (a portion).\n\n\u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u