    "chunk_text": "02. Lot No. 02 Name of the Land: Galkissa Watta, Assessment No. 37/2, Sri Dharmapala Mawatha; Description : Home Garden; Claimant: For acquisition to the government; Original Claimant: N. Y. Kasi Chetty, No. 11, Abeywickrama Mawatha, Mount Lavinia; Extent: 0.0531 Hectare.\n\nFurther, you are hereby requested to notify me in writing in duplicate before 03rd September, 2025 the nature of their interests in the land, the particulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land, the amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount. Deeds and other documents should be produced at the inquiry.\n\nM. M. K. Dilrukshi Walpola, Divisional Secretary, Ratmalana. At the Divisional Secretariat, Ratmalana, 22nd July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0324\n\n2 A III \u0dba\u0d9a\u0ddc\u0da7\u0dc3 - \u0dc1\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd3 \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u0db4\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dcf\u0dca\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dd2\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dc0\u0dcf\u0daf\u0dd3 \u0da2\u0dcf\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dba\u0dda \u0dd2 \u0dc0 \u0dc1\u0dd9\u0dba \u0d9c \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0da7\u0dca \u0db4\u0dad\u0dca\u200d\u0dbb\u0dba - 2025.07.28 Part III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.07.2025\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nAmendment THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS AMENED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT\n\n(AMENDMENT) No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7\n\nAcquiring Land for the Construction of Passara Puhulwatte\n\nLake, Upper Uva Development Programme stage 01\n\nRef. No. of the Ministry of Lands : 4/3/9/2011/IR/189. Ref. No. of the Divisional Secretary : BD/PS/LND/4/1/6-\n\nII. With reference to the Notice under Section 7 published in the corrigenda in the part III of the Gazette Extraordinary bearing number 2424/04 on 17/02/2025 by me, it is hereby give notice that the ownership inquiry scheduled for 21/03/2025 will be held on 29/08/2025 at 10.30 a.m.\n\nW. T. Gangani Somaweera, Divisional Secretary, Passara. At the Divisional Secretariat, Passara, 22nd July, 2025. EOG 07 - 0325\n\nProof THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460) AS AMENED BY THE LAND ACQUISITION ACT\n\n(AMENDMENT) No. 28 OF 1964\n\nNotice under Section 7"
