    "chunk_text": "1A \u2013 G 044965 \u2013 09 (07/2025)\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'28Part I: Sec. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.07.2025 2A\n\nColombo,03rd July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0327/1\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/04/2019/308.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON\n\n(1956 REVISED EDITION)\n\nOrder under Section 4(1)\n\nWHEREAS AN Industrial Dispute in respect of the matter specified in the statement of the Commissioner General of Labour which accompanies this order exists between,\n\nFlight Attendents Union, No. 01, Jayakontha Lane, Kirula Road, Colombo 05.\n\nand\n\nSri Lankan Airlines Limited, Third Floor, Eastern Tower, World Trade Centre, Colombo 01.\n\nNOW THEREFORE I, Dr. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour do by virtue of the powers vested in me by Section 4(1) of the Industrial Disputes Act, Chapter 131 of the Legislative Enactments of Ceylon (1956 Revised Edition), as amended by Acts, Nos. 14 of 1957, 4 of 1962 and 39 of 1968 (read with Industrial Disputes-Special Provisions) Act, No. 37 of 1968 hereby appoint Mr. C.A.H.M. Wijeratne, Attorney-at-law, No. 31/1, HPT Main Road, Liyanagemulla, Seeduwa to be the arbitrator and refer the aforesaid dispute to him for settlement by arbitration.\n\nDr. Anil Jayantha Fernando, Minister of Labour.\n\nColombo,03rd July, 2025.\n\nI fldgi: (I) fPoh \u2013 Y%S ,xld m%cd;dka;%sl iudcjd\u00a7 ckrcfha w;s \u00fafYI .ei\u00dc m;%h \u2013 2025'07'28Part I: Sec. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 28.07.2025\n\n3A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nMy No.: IR/COM/01/2019/308.\n\nTHE INDUSTRIAL DISPUTES ACT, CHAPTER 131 OF THE LEGISLATIVE ENACTMENTS OF CEYLON\n\n1956 REVISED EDITION\n\nFlight Attendents Union, No. 01, Jayakontha Lane, Kirula Road