    "chunk_text": "Exhibition Centers of Supplementary Register\n\nExhibition Center Lists or parts thereof kept for display\n\n01. Each District Election Office Full copy of the Supplementary List in the relevant electoral district\n\n03. Each Local Authority A copy of the Supplementary List section showing all the polling districts in the relevant local authority area\n\n04. Each Grama Niladhari Office A copy of the Supplementary List section showing all the polling districts in the relevant Grama Niladhari Division Instructions\n\n1. On behalf of the Registering Officer of each district, it is hereby notified that the preparation of Supplementary Lists 2025(1), 2025(2) and 2025(3) have been completed and that the said lists or parts thereof are placed at the aforementioned exhibition centers for inspection by the public during office hours, as per Section 20A(5) of the Registration of Electors Act and also that the Registering Officers mentioned in the Column II of the Schedule below for the electoral district mentioned in the corresponding Column I of the said Schedule have completed the preparation of Supplementary Lists on 29.07.2025, as per Section 20A(5) of the Registration of Electors Act."
