    "chunk_text": "01. Lot No. 01 \u2013 Galbokka Watta \u2013 Extent: 0.340 Hectare North: Galbokka Watta; East: Galbokka Watta and Katukithula Mukalana; South: Katukithula Mukalana and Galbokka Watta; West: Galbokka Watta.\n\nEOG 07 - 0341\n\n1A \u2013 G 044977 \u2013 14 (07/2025)\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.29\n\nPART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 29.07.20252A\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 72 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 13/96/FR/467. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: KDS/MDB/4/2/1/71/03. By virtue of the powers vested in me by the Order under Section 38 (a) of the Land Acquisition Act, (Chapter 460) I, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation, do hereby direct the Acquiring O\ufb03 cer or any other o\ufb03 cer authorized by him referred to in Paragraph 1 of the Schedule to take possession of the land speci\ufb01 ed in the corresponding entry in Paragraph 2 of that Schedule.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Land and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture Livestock, Land and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.24th July, 2025.\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nSCHEDULE\n\n1. Acquiring O\ufb03 cer.\u2013 Divisional Secretary, Medadumbara.\n\n2. Description of the Land.\u2013 The allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Preliminary Plan No. PP \u0db8\u0dc4 6664 dated 27.12.2016 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village called Mangoda (806) in the Minor Division of Udasiyapattuwa Korale in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Medadumbara in Kandy District of Central Province and bounded as follows:"
