    "chunk_text": "2. Description of the land.\u2013 The Allotments of land depicted in below names and extents in the Advance Tracing No. MO/BBL/2021/373 dated 25.11.2021 prepared by the Surveyor General, situated in the village called Malippota (FVP 21) in No. 102 B, Mallehewa Grama Niladhari Division in the Wegampattu Korale Minor Division of the Divisional Secretariat Division of Bibile in Monaragala District of Uva Province and bounded as follows:\n\n02. Lot \u2018B\u2019 - Weddegewatta \u2013 Extent: 0.1443 HectareNorth: Weddegewatta land claimed by W. W. Senewirathna; East: Road, Weddegewatta land claimed by H.M. Paduma\n\nIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01ce \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.29PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 29.07.2025 2A\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA.\n\nKumarihami, M.M. Priyantha Kumari and Malippotha Lake Reserve; South: Weddegewatta land claimed by H.M. Paduma Kumarihami, M.M. Priyantha Kumari and Malippotha Lake Reserve; West: Lot A and Weddegewatta land claimed by W.W. Senewirathna. EOG 07-0345\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013\u2013 Correction Paper\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nO\u0d8b\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b \u0d8e\u0d87\u0d7d\u0d7e\u0d8b S\u0d7e\u0d7c\u0d8d\u0d82\u0d88\u0d87 38 (a)\n\nOrder No. 21 of 2025\n\nMy Ref. No.: 4-3/2/2014/HA/218. Divisional Secretary\u2019s Ref. No.: \u0d87.\u021d\u0dcf.\u0dd9\u0262/5/5/14/2012/2-ii. IT is hereby declared that name of the land pertaining to Lot Nos. 44,45,46 and 47 stated as \u2018\u2018Pothugulkanda Watta or\n\nelse known as Pothugulkande Mukalana\u201d in Order No. 21 of 2025 published on page 2A of the Gazette Extraordinary No. 2429/15 dated 25.03.2025 of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka, shall be recti\ufb01 ed as \u2018\u2018Pothgulkanda Watta or else known as Pothgulkande Mukalana\u201d. K. D. L\u0d7a\u0d85 K\u0d7a\u0d87\u0d8d\u0d81\u0d7a, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMinistry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigations.\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d, No. 1200/6, Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla,24th July, 2025.\n\nEOG 07-0346"
