    "chunk_text": "1AIII \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3 \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.31PART III \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 31.07.2025\n\n\u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dbaThe Gazette of the Democratic Socialist Republic of Sri Lanka\n\n\u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 EXTRAORDINARY\n\n\u0d85\u0d82\u0d9a 2447/29 \u2013 2025 \u0152\u0263 \u0db8\u0dc3 31 \u0dc0\u0dd0\u01e7 \u022f\u0dc4\u0dc3\u0dca\u0db4\u01af\u01e6\u0daf\u0dcf \u2013 2025.07.31No. 2447/29 \u2013 THURSDAY, JULY 31, 2025\n\n(Published by Authority)\n\nPART III \u2013 LANDSPART III \u2013 LANDS\n\nLand Acquisition Notices\n\nTHE LAND ACQUISITION ACT (CHAPTER 460)\n\nDeclaration under Section 5\n\nI, Kuragamage Don Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation do hereby declare, under Sub-section (1) of Section 5 of the Land Acquisition Act, that the land described below is needed for a public purpose and will be acquired under the provisions of that Act.\n\nThe allotment of below mentioned land, Lot \u2018A\u2019 in total extent of about 0.0167 Hectare, depicted in the Advance Tracing No. GM/JAE/2024/97 and dated 03.07.2024, prepared by the Senior Superintendent of Surveys in Gampaha District on behalf of the Surveyor-General, situated in the Village of Ja-Ela in the Grama Niladhari Division No. 192 of Thudalla West in the Divisional Secretary\u2019s Division of Ja-Ela in Gampaha District in Western Province and bounded as follows:\n\n01. Lot \u2018A\u2019 \u2013 Sekkuwatta \u2013 Extent: 0.0167 Hectare North: The Ja-Ela Divisional Secretariat O\ufb03 ce located at Sekkuwatta and Road (R.D.A.); East: Road (R.D.A.); South: Road (R.D.A.) and Road; West: Road and Lot B.\n\nK. D. Lal Kantha, Minister of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation.\n\nMy No.: 4-3/3/2023/HW/262.Ministry of Agriculture, Livestock, Lands and Irrigation,\u201cMihikatha Medura\u201d,Rajamalwatta Road, Battaramulla.19th June, 2025.\n\nEOG 07 \u2013 0363\n\n1A \u2013 G 044988 \u2013 10 (07/2025)\n\nThis Gazette Extraordinary can be downloaded from www.documents.gov.lk\n\nPRINTED AT THE DEPARTMENT OF GOVERNMENT PRINTING, SRI LANKA."
