    "chunk_text": "4. The provision for incentive payment should be included in the respective year operating pro\ufb01 t. Marks allocation for NPL ratio criteria (a) Full marks allocated for the respective criterion will be given, if the actual NPL ratio of a branch/o\ufb03 ce is less than or equal to 5% (stage 03). (b) Full marks allocated for the respective criterion will be given, if a branch/o\ufb03 ce has reduced its NPL ratio by more than or equal to 2% within the year compared to the previous year. (c) Performance marks allocated for the respective criterion will be given proportionately if a branch/o\ufb03 ce has reduced its NPL ratio within the range of 0% - 2% compared to the previous year. (d) Performance marks allocated for the respective criterion will be given proportionately, if the NPL has been maintained between 5% to the Bank\u2019s actual NPL ratio. 5.2.2. The overall Performance marks for bank employees shall be computed as follows;\n\n\u2022 For Branch Employees\n\n\u2022 For District o\ufb03 ce Employees\n\nIncentive payment for a District o\ufb03 ce employee=Total earned performance marks by District (%)XPerformance incentive\n\n\u2022 For Province o\ufb03 ce Employees\n\nIncentive payment for a Province o\ufb03 ce employee=Total earned performance marks by Province (%)XPerformance incentive\n\n\u2022 For Head o\ufb03 ce Employees\n\nIncentive payment for a Head o\ufb03 ce employee=Total earned performance marks by the Bank (%)XPerformance incentive\n\nI \u0dd9\u0d9a\u02a3\u0da7\u0dc3: (I) \u0dd9\u0da1\u0daf\u0dba \u2013 \u027c \u0dbd\u0d82\u0d9a\u0dcf \u021d\u0da2\u0dcf\u0dad\u0dcf\u01e6\u01b5\u0d9a \u0dc3\u0db8\u0dcf\u0da2\u0dc0\u0dcf\u01cf \u0da2\u0db1\u0dbb\u0da2\u0dd9\u024f \u0d85\u01af \u026a\u0dd9\u0dc1\u0dc2 \u0d9c\u0dd0\u0dc3\u0178 \u0db4\u01b4\u0dba \u2013 2025.07.31\n\nP\u0d7a\u0d8b\u0d8d I: S\u0d7e\u0d7c. (I) \u2013 GAZETTE EXTRAORDINARY OF THE DEMOCRATIC SOCIALIST REPUBLIC OF SRI LANKA \u2013 31.07.20255A\n\nThen, the Human Resource Development and Administration circular no. 2019/124 dated 02nd December, 2019 and 2019/124 circular (Appendix I) dated 20th November, 2023 shall be considered for employee attendance to pay incentive payment. ** Performance incentive is equal to three months basic salary."
